WEBVTT

00:00:00.893 --> 00:00:01.950
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> Hi, Pia.

00:00:04.095 --> 00:00:05.095
How are you?

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:08.175
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Hi, Lin.

00:00:10.265 --> 00:00:11.917
I’m fine, and you?

00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:16.350
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> I’m fine too.

00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:21.119
This is Alex.

00:00:24.248 --> 00:00:25.935
He’s in my class.

00:00:29.091 --> 00:00:31.530
Alex, this is Pia.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.268
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Hi, Alex!

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:40.756
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Hi. What class are you in?

00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:45.407
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> That’s my bus!

00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:49.643
Bye. See you tomorrow!

00:00:52.736 --> 00:00:53.299
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Bye.

00:00:55.424 --> 00:00:56.924
Where are you from Pia?

00:00:59.536 --> 00:01:00.965
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> I’m from Italy.

00:01:03.917 --> 00:01:05.697
This is my bus stop.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:11.149
Bye, Alex. Nice to meet you.

00:01:14.214 --> 00:01:15.868
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Nice to meet you, too, Pia.

00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:20.174
What’s your phone number?

00:01:23.705 --> 00:01:25.744
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Sorry, my bus!

00:01:28.807 --> 00:01:33.254
It’s 07365…